[b]Hello taxi drivers!

It’s time for another devlog and some new info about the status of the development![/b]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35845552/d462d42e67e86020104a641076e123ed28464253.png[/img]

Here is the list of the things that we were working during the past couple of weeks:

*fully working GPS system;
*police chases (still polishing);
*payment system;
*dialogue system;
*mission system;
*simulation of traffic and pedestrians.


Also, we’re glad to confirm that the first part of the vertical slice is completed and we will show you more gameplay in the near future! For now, take a look at the bunch of fresh screenshots:

